BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:942bfd7c99fe68ae4e18f779bad79e7e@fyrisbio-calendar
SUMMARY:NAZA (Eng. sub)
DTSTAMP:20261111T032143Z
DTSTART:20261117T194500Z
DESCRIPTION:Kort tid kvar\n\nThe Guardian...🔍 Hebreiska Engelska Shot at ni
	ght on the rooftops of Tel Aviv\, the film reveals in detail the systems b
	ehind Israel’s calculated mass killing of Palestinian civilians in Gaza. D
	irected by Rachel Szor and Yuval Abraham (No Other Land). Executive produc
	er Jonathan Glazer (The Zone of Interest). --- The screening of NAZA on Su
	nday\, November 1\, at 8:00 p.m. will be followed by a 30-minute recorded 
	conversation with the film’s directors\, Rachel Szor and Yuval Abraham. Th
	e conversation was recorded in London on October 15\, in connection with t
	he film’s UK premiere. It is in English and will be shown without subtitle
	s. Moderator: Katharine Viner\, Editor-in-Chief of The Guardian Participan
	ts: Directors Rachel Szor and Yuval Abraham\, producer James Wilson\, and 
	executive producer Jonathan Glazer (director of The Zone of Interest). ---
	 Directors’ statement: We made this film out of a sense of obligation to u
	se our position as Israelis to examine the systems behind the mass killing
	 of Palestinian civilians for which our country is responsible. While film
	ing over the past three years\, we found ourselves asking the very questio
	ns that were asked by our grandparents’ generation and throughout the 20th
	 century: how does one group of people allow the total dehumanisation of a
	nother? What do the inner workings of such a system look like? Many of the
	 revelations in the film were published almost immediately as we learned o
	f them\, in the months following the October 7th attacks\, by The Guardian
	 (one of NAZA’s producers)\, in collaboration with reporting partners +972
	 Magazine and Local Call. The film lets us explore something deeper than w
	e could in our investigative journalism alone: not only the words being sa
	id but also those that are not said\, the silence. It is up to all of us t
	o break that silence. In Hebrew and English. The film is shown in both Swe
	dish-subtitled and English-subtitled versions. Which version is being show
	n is indicated after the film title in the calendar. Originaltitel Land Pr
	oduktionsår Premiär Längd Genre Åldersgräns Distributör Producent Språk Te
	xtning NAZA Storbritannien 2026 1 okt 2026 80 min Dokumentär Från 15 år Fo
	lkets Bio The Guardian...🔍 Hebreiska Engelska
URL:https://fyrisbiografen.se/naza-eng-sub
LOCATION:Fyrisbiografen\, Salong 1
DURATION:PT80M
END:VEVENT
